To keep the focus tight and avoid a protracted survival drama, the destruction of the 
\f1\b TPlusVirus
\f0\b0  must be a direct, rational outcome of the scientists\'92 own biological choices under the pressure of execution.\
When Hardy seals the lab, he cuts off their resource pipeline, turning the facility into a tomb. Inside, Hermann and Janine are trapped with two distinct entities: the lethal, weaponized 
\f1\b TMinus platform
\f0\b0  and the finite, life-extending 
\f1\b TPlus panacea vials
\f0\b0 .\
Here is the technical and narrative explication for why Gerry finds only the weapon decades later.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa331\partightenfactor0

\f2 \cf0 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs40 The Explication: The Consumption and Purge of the Pale\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 \cb2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f3\fs26 [ THE SITUATION: THE SUBSCRIPTION INVERSION ]\
When Jamison Hardy dropped the heavy security bulkheads on the Pale, he transformed the \
TPlus platform from a corporate luxury into a countdown timer. \
\
Hermann\'92s episomal architecture was flawless, which meant it was also fatal to the \
trapped scientists. The virus did not integrate; it floated freely in their nuclei, \
granting them pristine cellular rejuvenation for exactly a fortnight before their \
host genomes up-regulated histone methylation. Without regular maintenance doses, \
the epigenetic clearing took over. The code decayed. The biological clock restarted.\
\
[ THE CONSUMPTION: BUYING DAYS ]\
In the first months of the lockdown, the staff did not descend into savagery; they \
descended into logistics. They were geneticists trapped in a room with a finite vault \
of medical immortality. \
\
To stay alive, to outpace the crushing acceleration of their own methylation curves, \
Hermann, Janine Anstey, and the remaining research team systematically consumed the \
entire operational stockpile of the TPlusVirus. Every vial of the panacea was drawn, \
measured, and injected simply to keep their organ systems from failing under the strain \
of the facility\'92s failing life support. They became the sole consumers of their own \
subscription model, burning through the company's greatest asset to purchase weeks \
of breathable air and working minds.\
\
[ THE PURGE: JANINE'S FINAL INTERVENTION ]\
The real destruction, however, was deliberate. \
\
As the primary TPlus stocks ran dry and the systemic failure became an absolute certainty, \
Janine Anstey faced a terrifying realization: if Hardy\'92s clean-up crews eventually opened \
the vault, they would find the master sequences, the baseline extremophile templates, \
and the production logs. If Hardy recovered the TPlus data, his analysts would eventually \
trace the clinical trials back to the outside world. They would look at the genetic \
profiles of the trial families. They would find Sarah.\
\
Before the life support grid collapsed completely, Janine systematically purged the \
synthesis bioreactors. She ran a high-temperature autoclave cycle through the TPlus \
master cultures, denaturing the extremophile-augmented vectors into inert protein sludge. \
She wiped the active TPlus sequence schematics from the local drives. \
\
[ THE SURVIVAL OF TMINUS ]\
She left the TMinus platform untouched. \
\
To Janine, the target-specific bioweapon was an unmarketable horror\'97a precision execution \
tool Hardy would likely want buried forever. It was the perfect decoy. If anyone ever \
breached the bulkheads decades later, they would find the skeletal remains of the staff, \
the dead servers, and the pristine, stable vials of the lethal TMinus weapon locked in \
the cold-storage vault. \
\
They would assume the project had failed, or that Hermann had only ever succeeded in \
building a killer. The miracle\'97and the evidence connecting the Pale to a girl riding a \
bicycle in the park\'97was burned to ash before the air ran out.\
