\cf0 Does this clean, systemic explanation set up the exact conditions Gerry Hardman finds when he cracks the bulkheads open decades later?\
\
\
\
To address the 
\f1\b support staff
\f0\b0  without derailing into a survival thriller, you must shift the barrier from human conflict to 
\f1\b hard security architecture
\f0\b0 .\
If the lab is a high-level corporate facility, it wouldn't be a shared open space like a bomb shelter. A biological weapons laboratory handling target-specific pathogens (the TMinus platform) would be structurally compartmentalised to prevent accidental cross-contamination.\
By utilizing the facility's own 
\f1\b biosafety zone architecture
\f0\b0 , you can isolate the support staff and explain why they couldn't interfere with Hermann and Janine's consumption and purging of the TPlus virus.\
Here is the revised, tight explication that shuts down the 
\f4\i Lord of the Flies
\f0\i0  dynamic before it can start:\
